002	EXO	001	001	Wǝ tɵwǝndikilǝr Israil [bilǝn billǝ] Misirƣa barƣan oƣullirining isimliri (ular ⱨǝrⱪaysisi ɵz bala-qaⱪilirini elip, Yaⱪup bilǝn billǝ Misirƣa barƣanidi): —
