003	LEV	004	029	u ⱪolini gunaⱨ ⱪurbanliⱪining bexiƣa ⱪoyup, andin uni kɵydürmǝ ⱪurbanliⱪlarni boƣuzlaydiƣan jayƣa elip berip boƣuzlisun.
