003	LEV	013	004	Lekin ǝgǝr uning bǝdinining terisidiki pǝyda bolƣan axu yaltiraⱪ qiⱪan aⱪ bolup, ǝtrapidiki teridin ⱪeniⱪraⱪ kɵrünmisǝ wǝ tükimu aⱪirip kǝtmigǝn bolsa, kaⱨin bu jaraⱨǝt bar kixini yǝttǝ küngiqǝ ayrim solap ⱪoysun.
003	LEV	013	005	Yǝttinqi küni kaⱨin uningƣa ⱪarisun wǝ ǝgǝr jaraⱨǝt ohxax turup, terisidǝ kengiyip kǝtmigǝn bolsa, kaⱨin uni yǝnǝ yǝttǝ küngiqǝ ayrim solap ⱪoysun.
003	LEV	013	006	Yǝttinqi küni kaⱨin uningƣa yǝnǝ ⱪarisun wǝ jaraⱨǝtning rǝnggi suslaxⱪan wǝ kengiyip kǝtmigǝn bolsa, undaⱪta kaⱨin uni «pak» dǝp jakarlisun; jaraⱨǝtning pǝⱪǝt bir qaⱪa ikǝnliki bekitilip, kesǝl kixi ɵz kiyimlirini yuyup pak sanalsun.
003	LEV	013	007	Lekin ǝgǝr u kaⱨinƣa kɵrünüp «pak» dǝp jakarlanƣandin keyin xu qaⱪa terisidǝ kengiyip kǝtsǝ, undaⱪta u yǝnǝ bir ⱪetim kaⱨinƣa kɵrünsun.
003	LEV	013	008	Kaⱨin uningƣa yǝnǝ ⱪarisun wǝ ǝgǝr qaⱪa uning terisidǝ kengiyip kǝtkǝn bolsa, kaⱨin uni «napak» dǝp jakarlisun; u jaraⱨǝt pesǝ-mahawdur.
003	LEV	013	009	Əgǝr birkimdǝ pesǝ-mahaw jaraⱨiti pǝyda bolup ⱪalsa kaⱨinning ⱪexiƣa kǝltürülsun.
003	LEV	013	010	Kaⱨin uning jaraⱨitigǝ sǝpselip ⱪarisun; wǝ ǝgǝr terisidǝ aⱪ bir qiⱪan pǝyda bolƣan, tüki aⱪirip kǝtkǝn bolsa wǝ qiⱪan qiⱪⱪan jayda ǝt-gɵxi kɵrünüp ⱪalƣan bolsa,
003	LEV	013	011	bu uning bǝdinining terisigǝ qüxkǝn kona pesǝ-mahaw jaraⱨitining ⱪaytidin ⱪozƣilixi bolup, kaⱨin uni «napak» dǝp jakarlisun. U napak bolƣini üqün uni solaxning ⱨajiti yoⱪ.
003	LEV	013	012	Lekin ǝgǝr pesǝ-mahaw ⱪozƣilip, jaraⱨiti bar kixining terisigǝ yeyilip kǝtkǝn bolsa, kaⱨin nǝgila ⱪarisa xu yǝrdǝ xu «pesǝ-mahaw» bolsa, terisini bexidin putiƣiqǝ ⱪaplap kǝtkǝn bolsa,
003	LEV	013	013	undaⱪta kaⱨin uningƣa sǝpselip ⱪarisun; mana, xu pesǝ-mahaw jaraⱨiti pütün bǝdinini ⱪaplap kǝtkǝn bolsa, u jaraⱨiti bar kixini «pak» dǝp jakarlisun; qünki uning pütün bǝdini aⱪirip kǝtkǝn bolup, u «pak» dǝp sanalsun.
003	LEV	013	014	Lekin ⱪaqaniki uningda ǝt-gɵxi kɵrünüp ⱪalsa, u kixi napak sanalsun.
