003	LEV	013	016	Ⱨalbuki, ǝgǝr ǝt-gɵxi ⱪaytidin ɵzgirip, aⱪarsa u kixi yǝnǝ kaⱨinning ⱪexiƣa kǝlsun.
003	LEV	013	017	Kaⱨin uningƣa sǝpselip ⱪarisun; jaraⱨǝt aⱪarƣan bolsa, kaⱨin jaraⱨiti bar kixini «pak» dǝp jakarlisun; u pak sanilidu.
