003	LEV	013	042	Lekin ǝgǝr uning taⱪir bexi yaki paynǝk bexida ⱪizƣuq aⱪ daƣ kɵrünsǝ, undaⱪta xu jaraⱨǝt uning taⱪir bexi yaki paynǝk bexidiki pesǝ-mahaw kesilining bir alamitidur.
