003	LEV	014	048	Lekin kaⱨin kirip, ɵygǝ sǝpselip ⱪariƣinida ɵy suwalƣandin keyin waba uningda kengiyip kǝtmigǝn bolsa, undaⱪta kaⱨin ɵyni «pak» dǝp jakarlisun; qünki uningdiki waba saⱪayƣan bolidu.
