003	LEV	015	021	Ⱨǝrkim uning orun-kɵrpisigǝ tǝgsǝ ɵz kiyimlirini yuyup, suda yuyunsun wǝ kǝq kirgüqǝ napak sanalsun.
003	LEV	015	022	Ⱨǝrkim u olturƣan nǝrsigǝ tǝgsǝ, ɵz kiyimlirini yuyup, suda yuyunsun wǝ kǝq kirgüqǝ napak sanalsun.
003	LEV	015	023	Wǝ ǝgǝr birkim u yatⱪan yaki olturƣan jayda ⱪoyulƣan birǝr nǝrsigǝ tǝgsǝ, kǝq kirgüqǝ napak sanalsun.
003	LEV	015	024	Əgǝr bir ǝr kixi xu ⱨalǝttiki ayal bilǝn birgǝ yatsa, xundaⱪla uning hun napakliⱪi xu ǝrgǝ yuⱪup ⱪalsa, u yǝttǝ küngiqǝ napak sanalsun; u yatⱪan ⱨǝrbir orun-kɵrpimu napak sanalsun.
003	LEV	015	025	Əgǝr ayal kixining adǝt waⱪtining sirtidimu birnǝqqǝ küngiqǝ huni kelip tursa, yaki hun aⱪmisi adǝt waⱪtidin exip kǝtkǝn bolsa, undaⱪta bu napak ⱪan eⱪip turƣan künlirining ⱨǝmmisidǝ, u adǝt künliridǝ turƣandǝk sanalsun, yǝnǝ napak sanalsun.
