003	LEV	021	001	Pǝrwǝrdigar Musaƣa sɵz ⱪilip mundaⱪ dedi: — Sǝn kaⱨinlar bolƣan Ⱨarunning oƣulliriƣa mundaⱪ degin: — bir kaⱨin ɵz hǝlⱪining arisidiki ɵlgǝnlǝr wǝjidin ɵzini napak ⱪilmisun.
