#
# BOOK	006	JOS	Joshua	Yǝxua
006	JOS	001	001	Wǝ Pǝrwǝrdigarning ⱪuli bolƣan Musa wapat bolƣandin keyin xundaⱪ boldiki, Pǝrwǝrdigar Musaning hizmǝtkari, Nunning oƣli Yǝxuaƣa sɵz ⱪilip mundaⱪ dedi: —
006	JOS	001	002	Mening ⱪulum Musa wapat boldi. Əmdi sǝn ⱪozƣilip, bu hǝlⱪning ⱨǝmmisini baxlap Iordan dǝryasidin ɵtüp, Mǝn ularƣa, yǝni Israillarƣa tǝⱪdim ⱪilidiƣan zeminƣa kirgin.
006	JOS	001	003	Mǝn Musaƣa eytⱪinimdǝk, putunglarning tapini ⱪǝyǝrgǝ tǝgkǝn bolsa, xu jayni silǝrgǝ bǝrdim;
006	JOS	001	004	qegranglar qɵl-bayawandin tartip Liwanƣiqǝ, Ⱨittiylarning zeminini ɵz iqigǝ elip, Əfrat dǝryasidin kün petixtiki Ottura Dengizƣiqǝ bolidu.
006	JOS	001	005	Sening barliⱪ ⱨayat künliringdǝ ⱨeqkim sanga ⱪarxi turalmaydu. Mǝn Ɵzüm Musa bilǝn billǝ bolƣandǝk sening bilǝn billǝ bolup, seni ⱨǝrgiz taxliwǝtmǝymǝn.
006	JOS	001	006	Sǝn jür’ǝtlik wǝ ⱪǝysǝr bolƣin; qünki sǝn bu hǝlⱪni Mǝn ata-bowiliriƣa berixkǝ ⱪǝsǝm bilǝn wǝdǝ ⱪilƣan zeminƣa mirashor ⱪilip igilitisǝn.
006	JOS	001	007	Mening ⱪulum Musa sanga buyruƣan barliⱪ ⱪanunƣa ǝmǝl ⱪilixⱪa kɵngül bɵlüp, ⱪǝt’iy jür’ǝtlik wǝ tolimu ⱪǝysǝr bolƣin; sǝn ⱪǝyǝrgila barsang ixliring ƣǝlibilik boluxi üqün uningdin ya ong ya solƣa qǝtnǝp kǝtmǝ;
006	JOS	001	008	bu ⱪanun kitabini ɵz aƣzingdin neri ⱪilmay, uning iqidǝ pütülgǝnning ⱨǝmmisini tutup, uni keqǝ-kündüz zikir kilip oyla; xundaⱪ ⱪilsang yolliringda ƣǝlibilik bolup, ɵzüng ronaⱪ tapisǝn.
006	JOS	001	009	Mana sanga: — Jür’ǝtlik wǝ ⱪǝysǝr bol, dǝp buyruƣanidimƣu? Xunga ⱨeq wǝⱨimigǝ qüxmǝ, yürǝksiz bolma; qünki ⱪǝyǝrgǝ barsang Pǝrwǝrdigar Hudaying sǝn bilǝn birgidur.
006	JOS	001	010	Xuning bilǝn Yǝxua hǝlⱪning baxliriƣa buyrup: —
006	JOS	001	011	Silǝr qedirgaⱨtin ɵtüp hǝlⱪⱪǝ: — Ɵzünglar üqün ozuⱪ-tülük tǝyyar ⱪilinglar, qünki üq kün toxⱪanda silǝr Iordan dǝryasidin ɵtüp Pǝrwǝrdigar Hudayinglar silǝrgǝ beridiƣan zeminni igilǝx üqün kirisilǝr, — dǝnglar, dedi.
006	JOS	001	012	Yǝxua Rubǝnlǝr bilǝn Gadlar wǝ Manassǝⱨning yerim ⱪǝbilisigǝ sɵz ⱪilip: —
006	JOS	001	013	Hudaning ⱪuli bolƣan Musaning silǝrgǝ buyrup: — Pǝrwǝrdigar Hudayinglar silǝrgǝ aramliⱪ ata ⱪilip bu zeminni silǝrgǝ bǝrgǝn, dǝp eytⱪinini esinglarda tutunglar.
006	JOS	001	014	Hotun bala-qaⱪanglar wǝ qarpayliringlar Musa ɵzi silǝrgǝ tǝⱪsim ⱪilƣan, Iordan dǝryasining bu tǝripidiki zeminda ⱪalsun, lekin aranglarda ⱪanqilik batur palwan bolsanglar, silǝr ɵz ⱪerindaxliringlarning aldida sǝptǝ turup ularƣa yardǝm berip jǝng ⱪilinglar; taki Pǝrwǝrdigar Hudayinglar ⱪerindaxliringlarƣa silǝrgǝ ata ⱪilƣiniƣa ohxax aram ata ⱪilip, ⱪerindaxliringlarƣa u ularƣa miras ⱪilip beridiƣan zeminni igilǝtküqǝ xundaⱪ ⱪilinglar. Andin silǝr tǝwǝlikinglar bolƣan zeminni, yǝni Hudaning ⱪuli bolƣan Musa silǝrgǝ tǝⱪsim ⱪilƣan, Iordan dǝryasining kün qiⱪix tǝripidiki bu zeminni igilǝx üqün ⱪaytip beringlar, — dedi.
006	JOS	001	016	Ular Yǝxuaƣa jawab berip: — Sǝn bizgǝ ǝmr ⱪilƣanning ⱨǝmmisigǝ ǝmǝl ⱪilimiz, sǝn bizni ⱪǝyǝrgǝ ǝwǝtsǝng, xu yǝrgǝ barimiz.
006	JOS	001	017	Biz ⱨǝmmǝ ixta Musaning sɵzigǝ ⱪulaⱪ salƣinimizdǝk sanga ⱪulaⱪ salimiz; birdinbir tilikimiz, Pǝrwǝrdigar Hudaying Musa bilǝn billǝ bolƣandǝk sening bilǝnmu billǝ bolƣay!
006	JOS	001	018	Kimki sening ǝmringgǝ itaǝtsizlik ⱪilip, sǝn bizgǝ buyruƣan ⱨǝrⱪandaⱪ sɵzliringgǝ ⱪulaⱪ salmisa, ɵltürülidu! Sǝn pǝⱪǝtla jür’ǝtlik wǝ ⱪǝysǝr bolƣin, — dedi.
006	JOS	002	001	Əmdi Nunning oƣli Yǝxua ikki qarliƣuqini Xittimdin ǝwǝtkǝn bolup ularƣa: — Silǝr berip u zeminni, bolupmu Yeriho xǝⱨirini qarlap kelinglar, dedi. Xuning bilǝn ular u yǝrgǝ berip, Raⱨab atliⱪ bir paⱨixining ɵyigǝ kirip ⱪondi.
006	JOS	002	002	Lekin birsi kelip Yeriho padixaⱨiƣa: — Bügün keqǝ Israillardin birnǝqqǝ kixi bu zeminni qarliƣili kǝptu, dǝp hǝwǝr yǝtküzdi.
006	JOS	002	003	Xuning bilǝn Yeriho padixaⱨi Raⱨabning ⱪexiƣa adǝm ǝwǝtip: — Sening ⱪexingƣa kelip, ɵyünggǝ kirgǝn xu kixilǝrni bizgǝ tapxurup bǝrgin, qünki ular bu zeminning ⱨǝr yerini payliƣili kǝptu, — dedi.
006	JOS	002	004	Lekin u ayal u ikki kixini elip qiⱪip yoxurup ⱪoyƣanidi; u jawab berip: — Dǝrwǝⱪǝ bu kixilǝr mening ⱪeximƣa kǝldi, lekin mǝn ularning nǝdin kǝlgǝnlikini bilmidim;
006	JOS	002	005	ⱪarangƣu qüxüp, ⱪowuⱪni etidiƣan waⱪit kǝlgǝndǝ xundaⱪ boldiki, bu adǝmlǝr qiⱪip kǝtti. Mǝn ularning ⱪǝyǝrgǝ kǝtkinini bilmǝymǝn. Ularni tezdin ⱪoƣlisanglar, qoⱪum yetixiwalisilǝr, — dedi.
006	JOS	002	006	Lekin u ayal ularni ɵgzigǝ elip qiⱪip, ɵgzining üstidǝ rǝtlǝp yeyip ⱪoyƣan ziƣir pahallirining astiƣa yoxurup ⱪoyƣanidi.
