007	JDG	005	030	«Ular oljilirini yiƣip bɵlüxüwatⱪan bolmisun yǝnǝ?! Ⱨǝrbir ǝrkǝkkǝ [ayaƣ asti ⱪilixⱪa] bir-ikkidin ⱪiz tǝgkǝndu, Siseraƣa rǝngdar kiyimlǝr, Gül kǝxtilǝngǝn rǝngdar kiyimlǝrdin olja tǝgkǝndu, Bulangqining boyniƣa aldi-kǝyni kǝxtilǝngǝn rǝngdar kiyimlǝr tǝgkǝn bolsa kerǝk!
