010	2SA	011	025	Dawut hǝwǝrqigǝ: Yoabⱪa mundaⱪ degin: — Bu ix nǝziringdǝ eƣir bolmisun, ⱪiliq ya uni ya buni yǝydu; xǝⱨǝrgǝ bolƣan ⱨujuminglarni ⱪattiⱪ ⱪilip, uni ƣulitinglar, dǝp eytip uni jür’ǝtlǝndürgin — dedi.
