013	1CH	006	049	Ⱨarun wǝ uning ǝwladliri bolsa Hudaning hizmǝtkari Musaning tapiliƣinidǝk kɵydürmǝ ⱪurbanliⱪ sunulidiƣan ⱪurbangaⱨta ⱪurbanliⱪlar sunup, huxbuygaⱨta huxbuy yeⱪip, muⱪǝddǝsgaⱨdiki barliⱪ hizmǝtlǝrni ada ⱪilatti, xundaⱪla Israillar üqün kǝqürüm-kǝfarǝt ixlirini ⱪilatti.
013	1CH	006	050	Ⱨarunning ǝwladliri tɵwǝndikiqǝ: Ⱨarunning oƣli Əliazar, Əliazarning oƣli Finiⱨas, Finiⱨasning oƣli Abixuya,
013	1CH	006	051	Abixuyaning oƣli Bukki, Bukkining oƣli Uzzi, Uzzining oƣli Zǝraⱨiya,
