013	1CH	017	020	Aⱨ Pǝrwǝrdigar, ⱪuliⱪimiz toluⱪ angliƣini boyiqǝ Sanga tǝng kǝlgüdǝk ⱨeqkim yoⱪ; Seningdin bɵlǝk ⱨeqbir ilaⱨ yoⱪtur.
