013	1CH	029	023	Xuningdin keyin Sulayman Pǝrwǝrdigarƣa tǝwǝ tǝhtkǝ olturup, atisi Dawutning orniƣa padixaⱨ boldi wǝ intayin rawaj tapti; pütkül Israil hǝlⱪi uningƣa itaǝt ⱪildi.
013	1CH	029	024	Barliⱪ ǝmǝldarlar, palwanlar wǝ xundaⱪla padixaⱨ Dawutning oƣullirining ⱨǝmmisi Sulaymanƣa beⱪinip boysundi.
013	1CH	029	025	Pǝrwǝrdigar Sulaymanni Israil hǝlⱪi aldida naⱨayiti uluƣ ⱪildi; U uningƣa ata ⱪilƣan xaⱨanǝ ⱨǝywǝt xundaⱪ yuⱪiriki, uningdin ilgiri ɵtkǝn ⱨǝrⱪandaⱪ Israil padixaⱨlirida ⱨeq bolup baⱪⱪan ǝmǝs.
