014	2CH	003	001	Sulayman Yerusalemda Pǝrwǝrdigar atisi Dawutⱪa ayan bolƣan Moriya teƣida, yǝni Yǝbusiy Ornanning haminida, Dawut tǝyyar ⱪilip ⱪoyƣan yǝrdǝ, Pǝrwǝrdigarning ɵyini selix ixini baxlidi.
