014	2CH	032	030	Ⱨǝzǝkiyadin ibarǝt bu kixi Giⱨon eⱪinining yuⱪiri eⱪimidiki suni tosup, suni toptoƣra Dawut xǝⱨirining künpetix tǝripigǝ eⱪip kelidiƣan ⱪilƣanidi. Ⱨǝzǝkiya barliⱪ ⱪilƣan ǝmǝlliridǝ ronaⱪ tapti.
