019	PSA	006	001	Nǝƣmiqilǝrning bexiƣa tapxurulup, tarliⱪ sazlar ⱨǝm sǝkkiz tarliⱪ arfa bilǝn oⱪulsun dǝp, Dawut yazƣan küy: — Pǝrwǝrdigar, ƣǝziping tutⱪanda meni ǝyiblimǝ; Ⱪǝⱨring kǝlgǝndǝ meni ǝdǝplimǝ.
