029	JOE	002	019	Pǝrwǝrdigar jawabǝn Ɵz hǝlⱪigǝ mundaⱪ dedi: — «Mana, Mǝn silǝrgǝ buƣday, yengi xarab wǝ zǝytun meyini ǝwǝtimǝn, Silǝr bulardin ⱪandurulisilǝr; Wǝ Mǝn silǝrni ⱪaytidin ǝllǝr arisida xǝrmǝndǝ ⱪilip ⱪoymaymǝn;
