044	ACT	014	015	— Halayiⱪ, bu ixlarni nemǝ dǝp ⱪiliwatisilǝr?! Biz silǝrgǝ ohxax ⱨessiyattiki insanlarmiz! Biz silǝrgǝ bu ǝrzimǝs nǝrsilǝrni taxlap, asman-zemin, dengiz-okyan wǝ ulardiki barliⱪ mǝhluⱪlarni Yaratⱪuqi ⱨayat Hudaƣila ibadǝt ⱪilixinglar kerǝk dǝp jakarlawatimiz!
