044	ACT	015	029	— Butlarƣa atalƣan nǝrsilǝrdin, ⱪanni wǝ boƣup soyulƣan ⱨaywanlarning gɵxliridin yeyixtin wǝ jinsiy buzuⱪluⱪtin neri bolux — silǝr muxu birnǝqqǝ ixtin saⱪlansanglar, yahxi ⱪilƣan bolisilǝr. Aman-hatirjǝm bolunglar!»
