047	2CO	001	001	Hudaning iradisi bilǝn bekitilgǝn, Mǝsiⱨ Əysaning rosuli mǝnki Pawlus wǝ ⱪerindax bolƣan Timotiydin Korint xǝⱨiridǝ turuwatⱪan, Hudaning jamaitigǝ wǝ xuningdǝk pütkül Ahaya ɵlkisidiki barliⱪ muⱪǝddǝs bǝndilǝrgǝ salam!
