051	COL	004	016	Bu hǝt aranglarda oⱪulƣandin keyin, silǝr uni Laodikiyadiki jamaǝttimu oⱪutunglar, wǝ Laodikiyadikilǝrgǝ yazƣan hǝtni silǝrmu oⱪunglar;
051	COL	004	017	wǝ Arkippusⱪa: «Sǝn Rǝbdǝ tapxuruwalƣan hizmitinggǝ, toluⱪ ǝmǝl ⱪilixing üqün kɵngül ⱪoyƣin» — dǝnglar.
051	COL	004	018	Mǝnki Pawlustin ɵz ⱪolum bilǝn yazƣan salam. Mening kixǝnlinip ⱪamap ⱪoyulƣanliⱪimni ǝslǝnglar. Silǝrgǝ meⱨir-xǝpⱪǝt bolƣay!
#
# BOOK	052	1TH	1 Thessalonians	Tesalonikaliⱪlarƣa 1
052	1TH	001	001	Mǝnki Pawlus, Silas ⱨǝmdǝ Timotiydin Huda’Atimiz wǝ Rǝbbimiz Əysa Mǝsiⱨdǝ bolƣan, Tesalonika xǝⱨiridiki jamaǝtkǝ salam. Silǝrgǝ meⱨir-xǝpⱪǝt wǝ hatirjǝmlik bolƣay!
052	1TH	001	002	Biz dualirimizda silǝrni yad etip turup, Hudaƣa silǝr üqün ⱨǝrdaim tǝxǝkkür eytimiz;
052	1TH	001	003	Huda’Atimizning aldida etiⱪadinglardin bolƣan ǝmǝlliringlarni, meⱨir-muⱨǝbbǝttin qiⱪⱪan japaliⱪ ǝjringlarni, Rǝbbimiz Əysa Mǝsiⱨkǝ baƣliƣan ümidtǝ bolƣan qidamliⱪinglarni izqil ǝslǝp turuwatimiz.
052	1TH	001	004	Qünki ǝy ⱪerindaxlar, Huda sɵygǝnlǝr, Uning silǝrni talliƣanliⱪi bizgǝ ayan.
052	1TH	001	005	Qünki hux hǝwirimiz silǝrgǝ yǝtküzülginidǝ sɵzlǝr bilǝnla ǝmǝs, bǝlki küq-ⱪudrǝt bilǝn, Muⱪǝddǝs Roⱨ bilǝn, mutlǝⱪ jǝzmlǝxtürülgǝn ⱨalda silǝrgǝ yǝtküzülgǝn; uning üstigǝ, bizning silǝrning aranglarda bolƣinimizda silǝrni dǝp ɵzimizni ⱪandaⱪ tutⱪanliⱪimizni obdan bilisilǝr.
052	1TH	001	006	Xuning bilǝn silǝr eƣir azab-oⱪubǝt iqidǝ turuⱪluⱪmu, Muⱪǝddǝs Roⱨning xadliⱪi bilǝn sɵz-kalamni ⱪobul ⱪilip, bizni, xundaⱪla Rǝbning Ɵzini ülgǝ ⱪilip ǝgǝxtinglar,
052	1TH	001	007	xuning bilǝn silǝr Makedoniyǝ wǝ Ahaya ɵlkiliridiki barliⱪ etiⱪadqilarƣa ülgǝ bolup qiⱪtinglar;
052	1TH	001	008	qünki Rǝbning sɵz-kalami silǝrdin pǝⱪǝt Makedoniyǝ wǝ Ahayaƣila yangrap ⱪalmastin, bǝlki ⱨǝmmǝ yǝrgǝ Hudaƣa baƣlanƣan etiⱪadinglar toƣruluⱪ ⱨǝmmǝ yǝrgǝ hǝwǝr tarⱪiliptu; nǝtijidǝ, bizning [xu yǝrlǝrdǝ hux hǝwǝr toƣruluⱪ] ⱨeqnemǝ deyiximizning ⱨajiti ⱪalmidi.
